      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6ac7dba6cb42751584fffe75",
      "mergedPostDetails": "If possible, I think it would be a good idea to have the option to hide specific worlds we can choose so it doesn't have to pop up in friends playing / the world pages. Not only just a filter to filter out certain keywords/tags of worlds, but the ability to also block whatever specific world you don't want to see from showing up at all!\n\nI personally don't have problems for worlds I'm seeing while scrolling down, but there are people who feel really uncomfortable seeing certain worlds even scrolling through them, such as inappropriate worlds that people feel uncomfortable with seeing, or worlds that can bring bad memories to those—and I think that this feature can help players feel a bit more comfortable on VRChat! :)\n\nThis might be more of a small feature but can be really helpful for those that need to hides/block certain worlds or/and tags so they don't have to see them c:",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Option to Hide Worlds you don't want to see!",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "64dac0da1645d009b1ed7c41",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "_id": "6ac7dd03b70eb8bfa9893a4c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "63691297469f06772579fe6f",
        "alias": "Sage Meadowlark",
        "aliasID": "65c28116ed6eefce4c6d7d2d",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/0958f7577d869b58b8a4407e6b9fddab.png",
        "created": "2022-11-07T14:13:43.431Z",
        "name": "Fax",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2026-10-08T18:12:19.518Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6ac7dd03b70eb8bfa9893a4c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "There are worlds that otherwise do not fit any of the existing Content Gating categories that I still would very much prefer to not see in my Friend Locations menu or in the World Search for a variety of reasons (made by a user I have blocked, bad memories of the world in general, etc.). \n\nAn option to manually add individual worlds to your content gating settings would be a good solution to this. It's already possible to do this with individual avatars via the \"hide avatar globally\" option so it'd only be fair for an option like it to exist for worlds.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "It should be possible to \"block\" worlds.",
