      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6ac7dd3280b23e33fe04f9dd",
      "mergedPostDetails": "There are certain worlds that I do not want to see. \n\nIt makes me very uncomfortable when these worlds appear on my screen just because my friends happen to be in them.\n\nI would really appreciate it if you could implement a feature that allows users to block or hide specific worlds.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Feature Request: World Blocking Functionality",
